WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Raw Drive Rush approaches Ryu from neutral.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.600
Ryu blocks crouching medium punch.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.000
Luke backs away as Ryu attempts a throw.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Standing heavy punch catches the throw recovery as Punish Counter.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.950
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

6
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.950
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the punish.

7
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.700
Heavy Flash Knuckle finishes the conversion.
